B.DB=new A.ii("Looks like your shoulders could turn a bit more \u2014 turn them further as you take the racket back.","Looks like your shoulders are hardly turning \u2014 turn them sideways as you take the racket back.","Looks like your shoulders turn a little too much \u2014 try a slightly shorter turn.","Looks like your shoulders turn way too much \u2014 keep the turn more compact.","Nice shoulder turn \u2014 keep it up.")
B.DF=new A.ii(null,null,null,null,"Nice stretch between your hips and shoulders \u2014 keep it up.")
B.DC=new A.ii("Looks like your arm is a bit bent when you hit \u2014 let it reach out a little more.","Looks like your arm is very bent when you hit \u2014 give the ball more room and reach for it.","Looks like your arm is a bit too straight when you hit \u2014 keep a little bend in your elbow.","Looks like your arm is locked straight when you hit \u2014 keep a relaxed bend in your elbow.","Nice arm shape when you hit \u2014 keep it up.")
B.DD=new A.ii("Looks like you bend your front knee a bit more than you need to \u2014 stay a touch taller.","Looks like you\u2019re crouching very low \u2014 you don\u2019t need to bend your front knee that much.","Looks like your front leg is a bit straight \u2014 bend your knees a little more to get lower.","Looks like your front leg is almost straight \u2014 bend your knees more to get down to the ball.","Nice knee bend \u2014 keep it up.")
B.DG=new A.ii(null,null,null,null,null)
B.DE=new A.ii("Take the racket back a little slower \u2014 no need to rush it.","Your take-back is very rushed \u2014 take the racket back more slowly and smoothly.","Your take-back is a bit slow compared with your swing \u2014 get the racket back a little quicker.","Your take-back is very slow compared with your swing \u2014 get the racket back quicker.","Nice smooth rhythm \u2014 keep it up.")
